{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39823","headline":"经李翰林墓 · 殷文圭","name":"经李翰林墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗中日月酒中仙，平地雄飞上九天。\n身谪蓬莱金籍外，宝装方丈玉堂前。\n虎靴醉索将军脱，鸿笔悲无令子传。\n十字遗碑三尺墓，只应吟客吊秋烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39823.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39823","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}